+**Linear Interpolation Formula:**
+To find the intersection point $P$ on an edge between vertices $v_0$ and $v_1$ with scalar values $f_0$ and $f_1$:
+$$ t = \frac{iso - f_0}{f_1 - f_0} $$
+$$ P = v_0 + t \times (v_1 - v_0) $$
